## Runtime

### Preflight

Before executing any business command, check environment readiness:

```bash
python3 scripts/main.py preflight
```

Output is standard JSON:
```json
{
  "ready": true|false,
  "dependencies": {"<name>": {"status": "ok|missing", "hint": "..."}},
  "credentials": {"<name>": {"status": "configured|not_configured", "hint": "...", "required": true|false}},
  "services": {"<name>": {"status": "running|not_running", "hint": "..."}}
}
```

If `ready` is `false`, follow `hint` fields to guide the user. Do not ask for passwords or API keys in chat — direct users to edit configuration files.

